## Additional Use Grant

As the licensor, the author grants every user of the Software an
additional permission under these terms:

Use of the Software to browse, inspect, and perform operations on
data storage that is owned or controlled by You or Your Company is
a permitted purpose, even when the data stored there belongs to, or
a product or service built, operated, or maintained with the help
of the Software is offered to, customers or other end users.
For example, and without limitation, the following is a permitted
use:

    customer
        <- Company app / Web site / SaaS service
        <- Company own server / docker / Kubernetes
        <- Company S3 bucket
        <- Company-provided S3 bucket service

i.e. the Software may be used on buckets and other storage that
back, or are part of, the internal operations of a company's own
products and services, all the way to the end customer of that
product or service.

This grant does NOT extend to operating the Software on storage
space that is offered or provisioned to a third party as a storage
service (for example: buckets of a bucket/storage/hosting service
provider's tenants or customers, or any bucket used to deliver a
storage service to someone outside You or Your Company). Using the
Software on any such third-party-service bucket is not a permitted
purpose.


